finish, Architectural Class I,<MET> 0.018 mm</MET><ENG> 0.7 mil</ENG> and greater thickness of anodized coating producing natural aluminum color finish conforming 
to AA M21-C22-A41, as specified in <RID>AA DAF45</RID>.</OLI><BRK/>
